  "title": "From Cost Center to Revenue Generator: How AI Is Transforming the Banking Contact Center",
  "summary": "Banks and credit unions are sitting on an underleveraged growth asset. For years, the banking contact center has been measured almost entirely on efficiency with key metrics including handle time, first-call resolution, and cost per interaction. The primary goal was to manage a high volume of inbound service requests, and the technology available in past years did not offer much beyond that. Now AI is handling...",
